[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a></p><p>1. Prise off and remove the seal.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047008.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the seal has no\ncuts or cracks.</p><p>If this is not the case, replace the seal.</p><p>1. Fit the seal (1a) in its seating, starting from the top corner\n(1b) and positioning the reference mark (1c) on the seal at the\ncentre of the corner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047009.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a></p>"]]